<section id="graph" class="section graph-section">
  <div class="container graph-grid">
    <div>
      <h2 class="section-title">The graph of vulns that matter to you</h2>
      <p class="section-lead">
        Inspired by graph-native CNAPP platforms, OpenSourceOM builds a queryable model of your
        environment. Ask questions like “Which critical CVEs are internet-exposed and can reach
        production databases?” — and get an answer in seconds.
      </p>
      <ul class="graph-points">
        <li>
          <span class="dot critical"></span>
          <span><strong>Attack path analysis</strong> — trace lateral movement from ingress to crown jewels.</span>
        </li>
        <li>
          <span class="dot"></span>
          <span><strong>Identity blast radius</strong> — see what a compromised role can actually access.</span>
        </li>
        <li>
          <span class="dot"></span>
          <span><strong>Exposure-aware prioritization</strong> — deprioritize findings with no reachable path.</span>
        </li>
      </ul>
      <a class="btn btn-secondary" href="/docs/the-graph/">Learn how the graph works</a>
    </div>
    <div class="graph-panel" aria-label="Example security graph visualization">
      <div class="panel-header">
